Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Humpty Dumpty will reach the target area\Nin approximately five hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.15,0:00:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what about Westcott?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He hasn't moved from\Nthe hotel in Tengu City.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A girl thinks, "If only I was more honest."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A girl wishes, "If only I had more courage."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wish upon a shooting star.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:29.46,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Five:\N'Despair Comes Crashing Down'"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe we went a bit too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think she'd be that upset...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not as bad as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.43,0:00:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her mental state, mood, and happiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All have risen above the most severe level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's probably not used to getting\Ncompliments when she isn't transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Despite wanting to be acknowledged\Nfrom the bottom of her heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,she has zero self-confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:00:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:01:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi was saying nobody\Never paid attention to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like a few bad experiences\Nhave warped her idea of self-worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Beauty isn't the issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it whether or not someone\Naccepts Natsumi for who she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those guys, saying all those lies...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll find out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, Yoshino...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.61,0:01:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you taking a break, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what do you two think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About that one Natsumi girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Think, meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.83,0:01:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How disgusting can that Natsumi get?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's so ugly, it's not even funny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.76,0:01:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, I don't think Natsumi\Nis disgusting at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When she's that much of a\Ndisgraceful mess, it's an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.73,0:02:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up, Kotori?\NYou don't seem yourself today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get this, guys. They're \Nsaying weird things...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doubt. What weird things?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That Natsumi is pretty and she's\Nnot a pain to take care of...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think the one saying weird things is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Puzzled. That doesn't sound\Nlike something you'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't be talking\Nabout Natsumi like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--No way, it can't be... This means...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--That's such a funny face!\N--No way, it can't be... This means...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.69,0:02:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:03:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori? Sorry, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You seem down. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.07,0:03:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing's wrong, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, about Natsumi and her meals...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At last, here comes the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm wondering if we should\Nlet her out of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been giving it\Na lot of thought, and well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's gotta be lonely eating alone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if she ate yummy meals\Nwith everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think Natsumi might warm up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did I say something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her leaving candy behind is unthinkable...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.59,0:03:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways, there's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi... She escaped from the facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.85,0:04:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no use...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.27,0:04:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I looked everywhere, but no sign of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt she's here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness, here you--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pardon me for intruding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellen?! What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well. What does the great\NDEM want with little old me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I came to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A question?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The spirit you took away\Nthe other day, Witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I'm telling you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a nice house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I imagine you're all like\None happy family here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That happy family... Do you want to lose it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In exchange for the safety\Nof the other six Spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,tell me where I can find Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Any reaction from Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,None at Point A.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Same for Point B.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not good...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she's wary of us and refuses\Nto show herself again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? This reaction...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, but it's peculiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It could be a satellite based\Non its altitude and trajectory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's odd. Why would something like--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's magical power, but it's faint...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's... an explosive magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Enlarging the image!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bandersnatch...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll handle things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today's your lucky day, Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you found Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope... Had a bit of trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, I need you to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not going to believe this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...in a dozen or so minutes,\Na satellite will crash into Tengu City.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hold on a second! What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll explain later. It's dangerous\Nto be above ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get yourself to the nearest shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Tohka and them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. Where they're at,\Nthe debris won't leave a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Debris?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. We're blasting it to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep searching for Natsumi\Nas long as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if you can't find her,\Nevacuate before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm counting on you, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.99,0:07:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:25.46,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Spatial quake alarm official announcement"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--I'm scared\N--It's over here! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi! Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:30.47,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Spatial quake alarm official announcement"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, answer if you hear me! Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Debris from a satellite is about\Nto come crashing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous to be out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get to an underground shelter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't know where\Nto go, just follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.35,0:07:45.36,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Spatial quake alarm\Nofficial announcement"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it, Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We won't shut you in a room anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When this is over, you can\Ngo wherever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:07:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you go this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one you're searching for...\Nis just the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was trying to ruin your life...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I erased your friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I did those terrible things...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So why do you care about me so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.81,0:08:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander! The satellite!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time... Calculate the impact area!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ready? Let's blow it out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi! Are you around here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm right here! I'm right--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mistilteinn, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's odd...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:09:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine mere Bandersnatch Territory\Ndeflecting Mistilteinn like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bombardment from 12 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Displaying now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, we can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kannazuki, you're in charge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our war, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Camael.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Megiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gungnir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.09,0:10:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Target eliminated! Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Woohoo!\N--Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's a satellite!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.11,0:10:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Another satellite has appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Camael!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander, any more and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A second one. We'll recover you\Nwith Fraxinus, so stay put for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the shelter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't mean... But I haven't yet...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Among the lives you want to save,\Nplease let yours be one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?! Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In a little pinch, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a sad sight... To get\Nthis flustered over nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement. Try to remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So is that the satellite then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori, I'm not seeing Shido anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we do anything to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.48,0:12:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, you guys... My...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please protect my one and only brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's up to me then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Power... Lend me your power, Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.21,0:12:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With this, I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Kotori said you were\Nin trouble, so we had her send us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... And Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're busy fighting the enemy airship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, I think they'll be able\Nto handle it on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I honestly thought I'd be a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess they took it to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Outrage. Can't they read the mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We won't let them do as they please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellen? How nice of you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly, you should leave at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The board of director rebels are trying to--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because I believe they will fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just in case, let's send her to the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be a test of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gabriel, March!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's... incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew I liked this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting so pumped up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:14:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Might. Nice assist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, help me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's destroy that hunk of junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can do it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't? Why can't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know the details, but that has\Nsome sort of explosive magic on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless we destroy it higher up...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you forgotten who we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.71,0:14:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're hurricane children who mow\Neverything down, the Yamai sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pledge. We'll cast it \Naside like it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--C'mon!\N--Might!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.49,0:14:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.31,0:15:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll all work out somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like it did that time...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay. Someone will\Nshow up and help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Show up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.21,0:15:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone will...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A lollipop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,N-Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're trying to destroy\Nthe big thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go on already. Smash it to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B-But that has explosive magic on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph! Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There. Now you can manage it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Tohka!\N--Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was that because of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaleidoscope!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you're doing to Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The only one allowed to tease him...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is me, don't you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys, thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it was just me, I couldn't\Nhave saved everyone in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Disgusted that I changed into\Na lollipop and hid in your pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or are you upset that I didn't come help--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What... are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the one who hid myself\Nand watched as you panicked...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And before that, I did\Nterrible things to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why...? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.31,0:18:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your deal? Every last one of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dummies...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doing all those bad things...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Causing all of you trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you were all being nice to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was happy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I couldn't say thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank... you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, we'd have been\Nin trouble if you hadn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember how I promised\Nyou could go anywhere when it's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're okay with it,\Nwill you be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,N-Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.37,0:19:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Darling, you're making\Npoor Natsumi cry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.84,0:19:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? But I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't leave Natsumi to someone\Nwho only makes her cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I'll be your friend, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! No more teasing Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be your friend, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can be my kinswoman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement. We will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, you guys! You're making\Nme sound like the bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't teasing anyone to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apologize to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gimme a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.66,0:19:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.01,0:20:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really... think I'm cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, of course. You're cute, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Teach me how to do makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, you'll get good at it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.11,0:20:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About sealing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess there's no choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should've warned me\Nmy Spirit armor would disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! What were you thinking\Nin a place like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.32,0:22:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.66,0:22:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sealing in the middle of a city...\NThat's one wild fetish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.37,0:22:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Using an empty city to play out\Nyour deepest desires is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.25,0:22:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Darling is a bold one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.30,0:22:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What is it, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.31,0:22:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like it ain't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.31,0:22:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Another bomb is falling down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm out of strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.19,0:23:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...but I've gotta try!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.25,0:23:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.93,0:23:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ori... gami?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:41.50,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Six:\N'Crossroads'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.47,0:23:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
